stado s\\u00f3lido;<\\/p>\\n          <figure class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-card\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 460px; margin: 22px 0 26px auto; min-height: auto; padding: 14px 16px;\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/Captura-de-tela-2026-06-10-143834.png\\\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\\\"yes\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\\\"materia-condensada-teorica\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\\\"F\\u00edsica da Mat\\u00e9ria Condensada Te\\u00f3rica - imagem 1\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;text-decoration:none\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/Captura-de-tela-2026-06-10-143834.png\\\" alt=\\\"F\\u00edsica da Mat\\u00e9ria Condensada Te\\u00f3rica - imagem 1\\\" style=\\\"width:auto;height:auto;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;cursor:zoom-in\\\">\\n            <\\/a>\\n          <\\/figure>\\n          <p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__topics\\\">Supercondutividade; Sistemas fortemente correlacionados; Modelagem de materiais via teoria do funcional da densidade;<\\/p>\\n          <figure class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-card\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 460px; margin: 22px auto 26px 0; min-height: auto; padding: 14px 16px;\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/Captura-de-tela-2026-06-10-143850-1-hd.png\\\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\\\"yes\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\\\"materia-condensada-teorica\\\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\\\"F\\u00edsica da Mat\\u00e9ria Condensada Te\\u00f3rica - imagem 2\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;text-decoration:none\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/Captura-de-tela-2026-06-10-143850-1-hd.png\\\" alt=\\\"F\\u00edsica da Mat\\u00e9ria Condensada Te\\u00f3rica - imagem 2\\\" style=\\\"width:auto;height:auto;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;cursor:zoom-in\\\">\\n            <\\/a>\\n          <\\/figure>\\n          <p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__topics\\\">Materiais com spin crossover e intermet\\u00e1licos; Transi\\u00e7\\u00f5es de fase e fen\\u00f4menos coletivos.<\\/p>\\n        <\\/section>\\n        <!--<div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlights\\\">-->\\n        <!--  <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlight\\\"><strong>Sistemas materiais<\\/strong><span>P\\u00e1gina pronta para destacar temas, objetos e m\\u00e9todos de estudo.<\\/span><\\/div>-->\\n        <!--  <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlight\\\"><strong>Leitura qualificada<\\/strong><span>Hierarquia visual mais adequada para conte\\u00fado acad\\u00eamico.<\\/span><\\/div>-->\\n        <!--  <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlight\\\"><strong>Base institucional<\\/strong><span>Layout compat\\u00edvel com expans\\u00e3o editorial futura.<\\/span><\\/div>-->\\n        <!--<\\/div>-->\\n      <\\/div>\\n    <\\/div>\\n    <aside class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-card\\\">\\n        <h3>Navega\\u00e7\\u00e3o relacionada<\\/h3>\\n        <p>A navega\\u00e7\\u00e3o lateral facilita o retorno \\u00e0s p\\u00e1ginas principais e a conex\\u00e3o com outros conte\\u00fados de pesquisa.<\\/p>\\n        <a class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-link\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/#programas\\\">Voltar para pesquisa<\\/a>\\n      <\\/div>\\n    <\\/aside>\\n  <\\/div>\\n<\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(4122,614,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(4123,614,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(4124,614,'_elementor_version','3.32.1'),(4125,614,'_wp_page_template','default'),(4126,614,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"3dab422\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"95ba8e2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Adicione o texto do seu t\\u00edtulo aqui\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading