res, tomografias e a computação quântica.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Laboratórios\n					</a>\n									<h2>DIRETOR</h2>															<img width=\"769\" height=\"766\" src=\"http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Albert-Einstein.jpg\" alt=\"\" />','O Instituto','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2025-09-04 15:39:55','2025-09-04 18:39:55','',9,'http://localhost/fisica/?p=357',0,'revision','',0),(358,1,'2025-09-04 15:43:49','2025-09-04 18:43:49','','Formulário para Código 7','','inherit','open','closed','','formulario-para-codigo-7','','','2025-09-04 15:43:49','2025-09-04 18:43:49','',0,'http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Formulario-para-Codigo-7.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(359,1,'2025-09-04 15:44:16','2025-09-04 18:44:16','<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M542.22 32.05c-54.8 3.11-163.72 14.43-230.96 55.59-4.64 2.84-7.27 7.89-7.27 13.17v363.87c0 11.55 12.63 18.85 23.28 13.49 69.18-34.82 169.23-44.32 218.7-46.92 16.89-.89 30.02-14.43 30.02-30.66V62.75c.01-17.71-15.35-31.74-33.77-30.7zM264.73 87.64C197.5 46.48 88.58 35.17 33.78 32.05 15.36 31.01 0 45.04 0 62.75V400.6c0 16.24 13.13 29.78 30.02 30.66 49.49 2.6 149.59 12.11 218.77 46.95 10.62 5.35 23.21-1.94 23.21-13.46V100.63c0-5.29-2.62-10.14-7.27-12.99z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h2><a href=\"http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Temas-de-Monografia-2025.2.pdf\">Temas 2025/1</a></h2>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M384 320H256c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v128c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h128c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V352c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32zM192 32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32H32C14.33 0 0 14.33 0 32v128c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h95.72l73.16 128.04C211.98 300.98 232.4 288 256 288h.28L192 175.51V128h224V64H192V32zM608 0H480c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v128c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h128c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V32c0-17.67-14.33